modelFile [SimTalk]
Returns the name of the active model file and the folder within which it is located.
Type
Function
Syntax
modelFile → string
Return Value
The return value has the data type string.
Example
print modelFile // outputs for example D:\Public\Plant 
Models\MyPlantAnytown.spp
See also
Open Model File
saveModel [SimTalk]
modelFile [SimTalk]
